{"id":"firme","lemma":"firme","pos":"adj","rank":1520,"glosses":["firm, steady, secure","steadfast, unwavering, unswerving, firm","adamant"],"ipa":"/ˈfiɾme/","forms":{"femininePlural":"firmes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-firme.wav","examples":[{"text":"Firme aquí, por favor.","en":"Sign here, please.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/524832"},{"text":"Esta casa tiene cimientos firmes.","en":"This house has a solid foundation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527356"},{"text":"Sé educada, pero firme.","en":"Be polite, but firm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721459"},{"text":"Solo necesito que firmes aquí.","en":"I just need you to sign here."},{"text":"Mantenga firme la cuerda.","en":"Hold the rope tight.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586869"}]}